htra Real Estate Regulatory Authority)","url":"https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in","reraLink":"https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800027364"}},"BookPropertyEnabled":false,"structuredData":["\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Mumbai\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Properties in Mumbai\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/1a256\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Properties in Malad West\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/malad-west-1a256b7a91\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Triumph Ventures\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/malad-west-triumph-ventures-1a256b7a91b13a390\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Triumph Towers\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/projects/triumph-towers\"}]\n}","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When is the possession date for Triumph Towers?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Possession date of Triumph Towers is 30 Jun 2023\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the RERA carpet area range of Triumph Towers?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The RERA carpet area range for Triumph Towers is 765 - 1125 sqft\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price range of Triumph Towers?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The price range of Triumph Towers is ₹1.93 Cr - 2.84 Cr\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is Triumph Towers located?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Triumph Towers is located at Triumph Towers ,Bajaj Hall, Swami Vivekananda Rd, Malad, Pawan Baug, Liliya Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What configurations are available in Triumph Towers?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Triumph Towers has 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the status of Triumph Towers?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The status of Triumph Towers is Ready to move.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which amenities are provided in Triumph Towers?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Intercom Facility, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Library And Business Centre, Multipurpose Hall, Snooker / Billiards, Swimming Pool, Table Tennis, Yoga Area.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is the developer of Triumph Towers?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The developer of Triumph Towers is Triumph Ventures.\"}}]\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"Triumph Towers\",\n  \"image\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/100522113411-triumphven.png\",\n  \"description\": \"Introducing Triumph Tower, a stunning development with thoughtfully planned living spaces that feature well-designed apartments at affordable prices. With its remarkable apartments in Malad, Triumph Tower offers a lifestyle fit for royalty. Triumph Tower allows you to forget that you live in the heart of the city, making your home the perfect retreat after a long day at work. These residential apartments in Malad provide luxurious residences that seamlessly escape the city center's noise. Additionally, living in apartments in a prime location offers a range of advantages. Triumph Tower is ideally situated in Malad, providing unparalleled connectivity to all major landmarks and essential services, including numerous reputable medical facilities, schools, supermarkets, parks, entertainment venues, recreational centers, and more.\",\n  \"brand\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"Brand\",\n\t\t\"name\": \"Triumph Ventures\"\n\t},\n  \"offers\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/triumph-towers\",\n\t\t\"priceCurrency\": \"INR\",\n\t\t\"lowPrice\": \"19299420.00\",\n\t\t\"highPrice\": \"28381500.00\"\n\t}\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": [\n      \"SingleFamilyResidence\",\n      \"Product\",\n      \"RealEstateListing\"\n  ],\n  \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/triumph-towers\",\n  \"mpn\": \"P51800027364\",\n  \"brand\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/triumph-ventures-1a256b13a390\",\n    \"name\": \"Triumph Ventures\"\n  },\n  \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/triumph-towers\",\n  \"containedInPlace\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"@id\": \"Triumph Towers\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/triumph-towers\",\n      \"name\": \"Triumph Towers\",\n      \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"streetAddress\": \"Triumph Towers ,Bajaj Hall, Swami Vivekananda Rd, Malad, Pawan Baug, Liliya Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Malad West\",\n          \"addressRegion\": \"Mumbai\",\n          \"postalCode\": \"400064\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"IN\"\n      }\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Introducing Triumph Tower, a stunning development with thoughtfully planned living spaces that feature well-designed apartments at affordable prices. With its remarkable apartments in Malad, Triumph Tower offers a lifestyle fit for royalty. Triumph Tower allows you to forget that you live in the heart of the city, making your home the perfect retreat after a long day at work. These residential apartments in Malad provide luxurious residences that seamlessly escape the city center's noise. Additionally, living in apartments in a prime location offers a range of advantages. Triumph Tower is ideally situated in Malad, providing unparalleled connectivity to all major landmarks and essential services, including numerous reputable medical facilities, schools, supermarkets, parks, entertainment venues, recreational centers, and more.\",\n  \"floorSize\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"unitCode\": \"SQFT\",\n          \"minValue\": \"765\",\n          \"maxValue\": \"1125\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"image\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n          \"url\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/100522113411-triumphven.png\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"name\": \"Triumph Towers\",\n  \"offers\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"@id\": \"P51800027364\",\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"name\": \"Sale of Triumph Towers Unit\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/triumph-towers\",\n      \"price\": 19299420.00,\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n  }\n}\n"],"aiReviewSummary":{"summary":"Google reviews for Triumph Towers in Malad West indicate a generally positive reception, particularly regarding its upscale positioning and location. Residents and owners frequently describe it as a luxury-focused project with high-quality construction and \"hotel-like\" interiors. While many reviews highlight the lifestyle amenities and panoramic views, some feedback comes from professional brokers rather than solely long-term residents.","pros":[{"title":"Prime Location","description":"Situated on S.V. Road near MTNL Junction, offering excellent connectivity to Malad and Goregaon railway stations."},{"title":"High-Quality Construction","description":"Multiple reviews praise the \"exquisite craftsmanship,\" \"stunning architecture,\" and \"strong walls and pillars.\""},{"title":"Modern Amenities","description":"Includes a wide range of facilities such as a swimming pool, rooftop skydeck, gym, library, and dedicated sports areas (cricket pitch, football field)."},{"title":"Spacious Layouts","description":"Apartments are noted for having large bedrooms, well-ventilated spaces, and servant toilets on every floor."},{"title":"Accessibility","description":"Easy availability of public transport, including autos and cabs, right outside the complex."},{"title":"Proximity to Institutions","description":"Located very close to Durgadevi Saraf College and reputed schools like Orchid International."}],"cons":[{"title":"Premium Pricing","description":"Property rates are significantly higher than the average asking price for Malad West, which may deter budget-conscious buyers."},{"title":"Limited Feedback","description":"The volume of organic, long-term resident reviews on Google is relatively low compared to other major projects in the area."},{"title":"Traffic Congestion","description":"Being located on S.V. Road means residents often face heavy traffic and noise during peak hours."}],"verdict":["Ideal for Luxury Seekers","Strong Investment Potential","Ready-to-Move Reliability"]},"googleReviews":null},"isMobile":false,"footerData":{"featured":{"kolkata":{"label":"Kolkata","id":14},"mumbai":{"label":"Mumbai","id":256},"navi-mumbai":{"label":"Navi Mumbai","id":261},"pune":{"label":"Pune","id":300},"thane":{"label":"Thane","id":269}},"others":{"alibaug":{"label":"Alibaug","id":1907},"bangalore":{"label":"Bangalore","id":95},"noida":{"label":"Noida","id":84},"palghar":{"label":"Palghar","id":264},"raigad":{"label":"Raigad","id":3323},"telangana":{"label":"Telangana","id":3326}}},"__N_SSP":true},"page":"/projects/[project_name]","query":{"project_name":"triumph-towers"},"buildId":"t4LZHlTlBLViwyNa5GApO","isFallback":false,"gssp":true,"appGip":true,"scriptLoader":[]}</script></body></html>